    {
      "CultureId": "",
      "Name": "body",
      "Html": "<h2>Accessing Workflow Designer</h2><p>The workflow designer is accessed via the <strong>Business Processes </strong>page. Expanding a Business Process will display the workflows that are attached to it, to view the workflow designer for the workflow you wish to edit, you click on the&nbsp;<strong>\"Edit\" </strong>button on the row corresponding to it.</p><h2>The UI<br /></h2><p>When you access the workflow designer, you're greeted with something that looks like this:</p><p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"1001\" height=\"559\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" /></p><p><span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjk0Mjg1MjA3MCwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">This UI is quite complex and does require quite a high-level knowledge of our system to use. This is where the workflows are set up and it&rsquo;s what ensures that transactions import and offer generation is possible.</span></p><h2><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">Left-Hand Menu</span></h2><p><span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE5NjY1NDQ1MDMsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">The left-hand menu breaks down any possible tasks that our system can carry out within a workflow process.</span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\"></span></p><h3><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">Api</span></h3><p><span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjQ1NjAwMjU1NCwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">When you click on the Api section, this is how it is broken down:</span></p><p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"238\" height=\"323\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" /></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;background-color:#ffffff;\">This table breaks down each of them further, allowing you to understand their purpose. Clicking on any that have a + icon next to them will add it to the workspace on the right hand side.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;width:683px;height:203px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:24.1809%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;ApiDelete</td><td style=\"width:75.8191%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE0NDY0NDA4MjIsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">Allows the workflow to remove something from the database.</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:24.1809%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;ApiGet</td><td style=\"width:75.8191%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjQzNTkwNzkwMSwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">Enables the workflow to retrieve necessary information from the database.</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:24.1809%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;ApiGetCollection</td><td style=\"width:75.8191%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjcwMTMwNjYwLCJkYXRhVHlwZSI6InNjZW5lIn0K(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">Allows the workflow to retrieve collections of necessary data.</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:24.1809%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;ApiPost</td><td style=\"width:75.8191%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjQzMTA3MDUwLCJkYXRhVHlwZSI6InNjZW5lIn0K(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">Allows the workflow to create a new item in the database.</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:24.1809%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;ApiPostBatch</td><td style=\"width:75.8191%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE3NDI1NjUwOTQsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">Enables the workflow to create multiple new items in the database</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:24.1809%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;ApiPut</td><td style=\"width:75.8191%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE3NTAzNzgwNTgsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">Allows to workflow to update an existing item in the database.</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:24.1809%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;Authenticate</td><td style=\"width:75.8191%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE2NDg4MjUyODMsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">The app&rsquo;s overview, including the applications configuration.</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>B2B</h3><p><span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE3MTcwOTc5MjgsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">When you click on the B2B section, this is how it is broken down:</span></p><p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"253\" height=\"139\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE3OTgyMjQ5MzUsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">This table breaks down each of them further, allowing you to understand their purpose. Clicking on any that have a + icon next to them will add it to the workspace on the right hand side.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">&nbsp;</span></p><table style=\"border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;height:76px;width:694px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\"><tbody><tr style=\"height:25px;\"><td style=\"width:31.5203%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">CompanyImport<br /></td><td style=\"width:68.4797%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjk5MDA5ODc4MiwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">Ensures that the workflow can be used to import companies.</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height:25px;\"><td style=\"width:31.5203%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;Demo</td><td style=\"width:68.4797%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjEwNzQwMDEzMTYsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">Allows the workflow to create and import transactional data that is used for demonstration purposes.</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height:25px;\"><td style=\"width:31.5203%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;GenerateOfferParams</td><td style=\"width:68.4797%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#cccccc;text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE2ODEwNDg1NTMsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">This determines the parameters for the offer generation in the system, considering things like, the expiry time, Cut-off dates for example.</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Transformation</h3><p><span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjU0NDI3NTE2NiwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">When you click on the Transformation section, this is how it is broken down:</span></p><p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" width=\"258\" height=\"320\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjExMDA1OTkwNiwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">This table breaks down each of them further, allowing you to understand their purpose. Clicking on any that have a + icon next to them will add it to the workspace on the right hand side.</span></p><table style=\"width:694px;border-style:solid;margin-right:auto;margin-left:auto;height:76px;\"><tbody><tr style=\"height:25px;\"><td style=\"border-style:solid;width:218.43px;text-align:center;\"><span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjI3MzYyNjY0MiwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">Convert</span></td><td style=\"border-style:solid;width:474.57px;text-align:center;\"><span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjEzNjk2ODg3ODcsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse:preserve;\">Allows the workflow to convert to one file format to another.</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height:25px;\"><td style=\"border-style:solid;width:218.43px;text-align:center;\"><span data-metadata=\"<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiZW1aN281RHZZWTVGdTZpZzZGTkFKZiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE4NzAzMDE4ODgsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->\"></span><span data-buffer=\"<!--(figma)(/figma)-->\"></span><sp